# Own cell (no ICDD input). Predicted OQMD 2154926 (Pm-3m, Al8FeCo7/Al4FeCo3 B2 superstructure) with the Fe/Co order
# kept and the Al order reduced to eta = 0.9 by the occ() rule of scripts/phaseid_order_ladder.py: every Al site
# = occ(average, {Al: 1}, 0.9) = Al 0.95 + (Fe,Co) 0.05 at the average Fe:Co ratio (the B2 ladder's A site);
# every Fe or Co site keeps its element at 0.95 and takes Al 0.05 (the ladder's B-site Al). Averaged over the
# transition-metal sites this is exactly the B2 eta0.90 ladder cell (results/phaseid/0535/order_ladder/eta0.90.cif).
# Lattice: cubic a = 2 x 2.864 A, the ladder cell (DFT a = 5.7000 A); DFT fractional coordinates kept.
# generated using pymatgen
